      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i suspected the solenoids. i've seen cases where tiny bits of debris get stuck in there and mess everything up. besides physical clogs or mechanical failure, is there any chance it's just some kind of weird electronic interference or something throwing off the signals in the circuit? like, could something just be randomly making the system act up for no clear reason?",
